# krome_init_abund.dat — initial species mixing ratios for krome_solve
#
# Used when INITAB=1 in the MARCS input file.
# Species names must match those in ./krome/build_DMS_v2/info.log exactly
# (same case, no trailing spaces).
# Species not listed here receive the default abundance (1E-20) as their
# initial guess and then evolve freely via GGchem equilibrium + KROME
# non-equilibrium chemistry (with eddy mixing) for the rest of the run.
#
# IMPORTANT: krome_init_abund_on applies this file's mixing ratios on
# EVERY iteration, not just at t=0 (marcs.f ~line 16729-16735, outside the
# first_call gate) -- any species listed here is force-reset every cycle,
# which prevents it from ever developing altitude structure. Only list
# species here that should behave as fixed, well-mixed bulk reservoirs.
#
# v2: adds CH4 to the fixed set (see
# krome_init_abund_earth_modern_N2O2CO2only.dat for the first attempt with
# only N2/O2/CO2 pinned). That run oscillated persistently and never
# converged (T corrections cycling +-100K+ through iteration 100, final
# pressure structure unphysical). CH4's real atmospheric abundance (~1.9
# ppm) is sustained by biological production, same as O2 -- neither
# equilibrium nor non-eq gas-phase chemistry in this network produces it
# from N2/O2/CO2, so leaving it free let it collapse toward the 1E-20
# floor (observed: log(CH4) crashed to -16 to -37 across the column vs.
# an expected steady ~1.9ppm). Losing a real greenhouse gas entirely
# mid-run is a plausible driver of the oscillation/instability. Testing
# whether pinning CH4 alongside N2/O2/CO2 (still leaving O3 and everything
# else free) resolves it.
#
# --- Fixed bulk reservoir species (modern Earth, NOAA/NASA reference) ---
N2        7.8084E-01   # dominant background
O2        2.0946E-01   # modern oxygen-rich atmosphere (post-GOE)
CO2       4.2000E-04   # ~420 ppm, current
CH4       1.9000E-06   # ~1900 ppb; biogenic source, not reproduced by
                        # equilibrium/non-eq gas-phase chemistry alone
#
# All other species (H2O, O3, N2O, CO, H2, SO2, H2S, O, H, OH, HO2, NO,
# NO2, etc.) default to 1E-20 initial guess and evolve to whatever GGchem
# equilibrium + KROME non-eq photochemistry + eddy mixing produce.
